      "html_anchor": "sec-IsHTMLDDA-internal-slot-to-boolean",
      "html_line_start": 52833,
      "html_line_end": 52833,
      "exact_quote": "<emu-alg replaces-step=\"step-to-boolean-web-compat-insertion-point\"><ol start=\"3\"><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"list-marker\">3. </span>If <var>argument</var> <emu-xref href=\"#sec-object-type\" id=\"_ref_16819\"><a href=\"#sec-object-type\">is an Object</a></emu-xref> and <var>argument</var> has an <var class=\"field\">[[IsHTMLDDA]]</var> internal slot, return <emu-val>false</emu-val>.</li></ol></emu-alg>",
      "context_before": "52832:       <p>The following step replaces step <emu-xref href=\"#step-to-boolean-web-compat-insertion-point\" id=\"_ref_891\"><a href=\"#step-to-boolean-web-compat-insertion-point\">3</a></emu-xref> of <emu-xref aoid=\"ToBoolean\" id=\"_ref_16818\"><a href=\"#sec-toboolean\">ToBoolean</a></emu-xref>:</p>",
      "context_after": "52834:       </emu-annex>",
