    {
      "fragment_id": "ECMASCRIPT-2025-TOB-005",
      "document_id": "ecmascript-2025-html",
      "publisher": "Ecma International",
      "specification_version": "2025",
      "source_kind": "HTML",
      "section_number": "6.1",
      "section_heading": "ECMAScript Language Types",
      "html_anchor": "sec-ecmascript-language-types",
      "html_line_start": 1986,
      "html_line_end": 1987,
      "exact_quote": "are Undefined, Null, Boolean, String, Symbol, Number, BigInt, and Object. An <dfn variants=\"ECMAScript language values\" tabindex=\"-1\">ECMAScript language value</dfn> is a value that is characterized by an ECMAScript language type.",
      "context_before": "1984:  corresponds to values that are directly manipulated by an ECMAScript\n1985: programmer using the ECMAScript language. The ECMAScript language types are",
      "context_after": "1988: \n1989:     <emu-clause id=\"sec-ecmascript-language-types-undefined-type\">",
      "local_source_path": "documents/sources/ecmascript/2025/raw/specification.html",
      "source_sha256": "6a28f9423133ed7b7c59a40baf620c2740f12f0bc9c251042f2a85b9cc5ed713",
      "fragment_sha256": null,
      "reason_for_inclusion": "Sets the domain of all ECMAScript language values used by ToBoolean."
    },
    {
      "fragment_id": "ECMASCRIPT-2025-TOB-006",
      "document_id": "ecmascript-2025-html",
      "publisher": "Ecma International",
      "specification_version": "2025",
      "source_kind": "HTML",
      "section_number": "6.1.3",
      "section_heading": "The Boolean Type",
      "html_anchor": "sec-ecmascript-language-types-boolean-type",
      "html_line_start": 2001,
      "html_line_end": 2001,
      "exact_quote": "<p>The <dfn variants=\"is a Boolean,is not a Boolean\" tabindex=\"-1\">Boolean type</dfn> represents a logical entity having two values, called <emu-val>true</emu-val> and <emu-val>false</emu-val>.</p>",
      "context_before": "1999:       <emu-clause id=\"sec-ecmascript-language-types-boolean-type\">",
      "context_after": "2002:     </emu-clause>",
      "local_source_path": "documents/sources/ecmascript/2025/raw/specification.html",
      "source_sha256": "6a28f9423133ed7b7c59a40baf620c2740f12f0bc9c251042f2a85b9cc5ed713",
      "fragment_sha256": null,
      "reason_for_inclusion": "Confirms that Boolean has exactly true and false values."
    },
    {
      "fragment_id": "ECMASCRIPT-2025-TOB-007",
      "document_id": "ecmascript-2025-html",
      "publisher": "Ecma International",
      "specification_version": "2025",
      "source_kind": "HTML",
      "section_number": "6.1.4",
      "section_heading": "The String Type",
      "html_anchor": "sec-ecmascript-language-types-string-type",
      "html_line_start": 2014,
      "html_line_end": 2015,
      "exact_quote": "The empty String has length zero and therefore contains no elements.</p>",
      "context_before": "2009: String is treated as a UTF-16 code unit value. Each element is regarded\n2010: as occupying a position within the sequence. These positions are indexed\n2011: with non-negative <emu-xref href=\"#integer\" id=\"_ref_1277\"><a href=\"#integer\">integers</a></emu-xref>.\n2012:  The first element (if any) is at index 0, the next element (if any) at\n2013:  index 1, and so on.",
      "context_after": "2016:       <p>ECMAScript operations that do not interpret String contents",
      "local_source_path": "documents/sources/ecmascript/2025/raw/specification.html",
      "source_sha256": "6a28f9423133ed7b7c59a40baf620c2740f12f0bc9c251042f2a85b9cc5ed713",
      "fragment_sha256": null,
      "reason_for_inclusion": "Supports the empty-String falsy criterion in ToBoolean."
    },
    {
      "fragment_id": "ECMASCRIPT-2025-TOB-008",
      "document_id": "ecmascript-2025-html",
      "publisher": "Ecma International",
      "specification_version": "2025",
      "source_kind": "HTML",
      "section_number": "6.1.6.1",
      "section_heading": "The Number Type",
      "html_anchor": "sec-ecmascript-language-types-number-type",
      "html_line_start": 2749,
      "html_line_end": 2749,
      "exact_quote": "Note that there is both a <emu-val>positive zero</emu-val> and a <emu-val>negative zero</emu-val>.",
      "context_before": "2748:         <p>The remaining 9,007,199,254,740,990 (that is, <emu-eqn class=\"inline\">2<span aria-hidden=\"true\">**</span><sup>53</sup> - 2</emu-eqn>) values are denormalized, having the form</p>",
      "context_after": "2750:         <p>18,437,736,874,454,810,622 ...</p>",
      "local_source_path": "documents/sources/ecmascript/2025/raw/specification.html",
      "source_sha256": "6a28f9423133ed7b7c59a40baf620c2740f12f0bc9c251042f2a85b9cc5ed713",
      "fragment_sha256": null,
