      "exact_quote": "except that the 9,007,199,254,740,990 (that is, <emu-eqn class=\"inline\">2<span aria-hidden=\"true\">**</span><sup>53</sup> - 2</emu-eqn>) distinct NaN values of the IEEE Standard are represented in ECMAScript as a single special <emu-val>NaN</emu-val> value.",
