      "html_anchor": "sec-ecmascript-language-types-bigint-type",
      "html_line_start": 2947,
      "html_line_end": 2947,
      "exact_quote": "<p>The <dfn variants=\"is a BigInt,is not a BigInt\" tabindex=\"-1\">BigInt type</dfn> represents an <emu-xref href=\"#integer\" id=\"_ref_1490\"><a href=\"#integer\">integer</a></emu-xref>",
